: "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2608663, "client_id": 2010193, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fa2c90b7/uploads/origins/7cc94b04-ccb5-48d8-b801-26466d5cff72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04ff07b4e2c7c151f05d308985194a4c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fa2c90b7/uploads/origins/7cc94b04-ccb5-48d8-b801-26466d5cff72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04ff07b4e2c7c151f05d308985194a4c, https://si.imgix.net/fa2c90b7/uploads/origins/7cc94b04-ccb5-48d8-b801-26466d5cff72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3cc3057754cb95f10c98735a915ec4e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fa2c90b7/uploads/origins/7cc94b04-ccb5-48d8-b801-26466d5cff72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c8c5632d2fc65ff553f3c6531e86740 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fa2c90b7/uploads/origins/7cc94b04-ccb5-48d8-b801-26466d5cff72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a6b9d2a004cf98651fe622e3a56902dc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fa2c90b7/uploads/origins/7cc94b04-ccb5-48d8-b801-26466d5cff72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a6b9d2a004cf98651fe622e3a56902dc, https://si.imgix.net/fa2c90b7/uploads/origins/7cc94b04-ccb5-48d8-b801-26466d5cff72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3076e327cd6c32174cf5f0703a0bae50 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fa2c90b7/uploads/origins/7cc94b04-ccb5-48d8-b801-26466d5cff72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d88e44399ac4254386d382478dbe461b 3x"}, "body": "Hello, my name is Unikross.\nI would like to contact Mr. Souku Ryu Kaya to make a request.\nI would like you to draw the four people in ABCD shown here.\nIf there are any problems with the amount of money, please feel free to resend it to me.\n\nRegarding the relationship\nThe relationship between A and B is that of lovers, junior and senior.\nThe relationship between C and D is unclear and has not yet developed into a romance. They are very important to each other.\nThey are also juniors and seniors.\nThey are university students who belong to an occult circle and get along very well with each other, going on trips, etc.\n\nA tends to be naughty, hugging, biting and kissing B at every opportunity.\nB tries to avoid A, but when he gets close to A, he turns red and tries to run away, but it ends in vain.\nC values D more than others.\nD is important to all of us, but I feel that C is somewhat special....\nI would be happy if the atmosphere is something like this.\nI have set the NSFW for now, but I would appreciate it if you could draw it as you like, Aoikuryu Kaya.\nThank you very much.\n\nI would like to use it for the following purposes.\nI would like to use it as a wallpaper or icon on SNS or discord for myself and my partner.\nWe would like to use your drawings on our SNS and discord for our own and other people's wallpaper and icons.\nTo be made into goods for personal viewing and non-commercial use for you and your partner.\nAny of the above that are not for personal use.\n\nWe are four irreplaceable friends, and we look forward to working with you.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1ppNWPtyBCu3Fa6Fha0g_6NwjTQAHrokT", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aoisisioa/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2608663, "client_id": 3294487, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74eb82fb/uploads/origins/67c63f78-dc4e-41ae-bdbd-a2cbd7d60dc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a2372d7ab78b3840deeca6280689d5c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74eb82fb/uploads/origins/67c63f78-dc4e-41ae-bdbd-a2cbd7d60dc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a2372d7ab78b3840deeca6280689d5c, https://si.imgix.net/74eb82fb/uploads/origins/67c63f78-dc4e-41ae-bdbd-a2cbd7d60dc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2158ad75f5a28164c32085acb3039ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74eb82fb/uploads/origins/67c63f78-dc4e-41ae-bdbd-a2cbd7d60dc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b881ed8c183e72731a7284487585019e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74eb82fb/uploads/origins/67c63f78-dc4e-41ae-bdbd-a2cbd7d60dc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2012ec9a23eb97350715f2b26cac553e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74eb82fb/uploads/origins/67c63f78-dc4e-41ae-bdbd-a2cbd7d60dc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2012ec9a23eb97350715f2b26cac553e, https://si.imgix.net/74eb82fb/uploads/origins/67c63f78-dc4e-41ae-bdbd-a2cbd7d60dc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ac9aada74242cd062d866406679ee86a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74eb82fb/uploads/origins/67c63f78-dc4e-41ae-bdbd-a2cbd7d60dc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b9f93b222bbd3c89aaf93187705be501 3x"}, "body": "This may be an illustration or a very unusual request, but it is a request to create an elementary body illustration based on your understanding of the structure of the human body as seen in your drawings and the fact that you are a lecturer.\nI am having trouble understanding the connection between the neck, head, and shoulders in particular when drawing the human figure, and since I fundamentally dislike humans, I am sick and tired of observing them and have trouble doing it properly. I am having trouble observing people properly because I fundamentally dislike them. I thought I might be able to remember if I refer to illustrations of my favorite types.\nRequirements for creation\nI would like to use a boy around 14 years old as a model.\nThe illustration should be above the shoulders.\nThe connection between the neck, head, and shoulders should be clear.\nI would like you to use your illustration, not a realistic one.\nWe would like you to draw several illustrations.\nFor example, I can see the front view, but I would like you to draw an illustration that shows the position of the neck when the shoulders are slanted, the bend of the neck and the position of the face when the neck is swung to the left or right, and the position of the face when the head is turned to the right or left while facing straight ahead, so that I can compare it with the normal state.\nAs an aside, I prefer a simple boy like villager A to a beautiful boy.\nThank you in advance.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aoisisioa/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2608663, "client_id": 3185039, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb7942fd/uploads/origins/a8316374-318c-49ce-b2b1-7f097f5f47e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8abf006819a2960adf75c2b72ba33d2f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb7942fd/uploads/origins/a8316374-318c-49ce-b2b1-7f097f5f47e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8abf006819a2960adf75c2b72ba33d2f, https://si.imgix.net/cb7942fd/uploads/origins/a8316374-318c-49ce-b2b1-7f097f5f47e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4325092bf804bb68543e46a3c994da94 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb7942fd/uploads/origins/a8316374-318c-49ce-b2b1-7f097f5f47e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d34be59d2be9a967fc2ba4f57fb1cf90 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb7942fd/uploads/origins/a8316374-318c-49ce-b2b1-7f097f5f47e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c02ea373fcadc65107ab555f939df434", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb7942fd/uploads/origins/a8316374-318c-49ce-b2b1-7f097f5f47e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c02ea373fcadc65107ab555f939df434, https://si.imgix.net/cb7942fd/uploads/origins/a8316374-318c-49ce-b2b1-7f097f5f47e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3928ec9b4e9db4179f10bdb8152242f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb7942fd/uploads/origins/a8316374-318c-49ce-b2b1-7f097f5f47e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b80e3b4276be534e77ddc04506dbebc 3x"}, "body": "Hello. Thank you for the bunny boy project the other day.\nI really liked the man drawn by Souku Ryukaya, so I sent him a request.\n\nThe contents of the request are as follows\nI would like an illustration of our original character \"Danas\" (please refer to the section \"Danas-Akatic\" in the resource URL) and an inverted character of Danas fighting each other, or rather, a composition of Danas resisting being attacked by the inverted character.\n\nRelationship between the two\nThe main body Danas: does not want to acknowledge the existence of the inverted Danas and does not want to look directly at him. The rejection is the first step.\nInverted Danas: The embodiment of Danas' subconscious immoral side. He has a one-sided, obsessive (even abusive) fondness for the main body Danas, and wants to take it in.\nI don't have any data on the inverted character, but I imagine the same face but opposite in color and personality, with inverted eyes. (For your information, Danas is calm and quiet, and the inverted character is nervous and aggressive.)\n\nPurpose of use\nPersonal viewing and posting on SNS (io's account)\n\nThis is a request for two illustrations, so if the price is not reasonable, I would appreciate it if you could resend the request.\nWe apologize for the fluffiness of this request, but we would appreciate your consideration.\nThank you very much.\n\nhttps://misskey.io/@kyoka_h/pages/1717201985095", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aoisisioa/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/607db088/uploads/origins/aeb31df2-c485-4f75-ac9b-f99b86eafa7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=edfb9f11bcf31d9e9a4f8fc931ceec36", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/607db088/uploads/origins/aeb31df2-c485-4f75-ac9b-f99b86eafa7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=edfb9f11bcf31d9e9a4f8fc931ceec36, https://si.imgix.net/607db088/uploads/origins/aeb31df2-c485-4f75-ac9b-f99b86eafa7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0650b22da4118a71bb4bc7daf38f1387 2x, https://si.imgix.net/607db088/uploads/origins/aeb31df2-c485-4f75-ac9b-f99b86eafa7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d584253a95e3722890629eb3cca2ac56 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2608663, "nc": 48}, {"path": "/@aoisisioa/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped