 request this time is Taihei's Taihei-chan,\nI have often been commissioned to draw her myself, even though she is a child of another artist. (Of course, I have the approval of the artist.)\n\nShe has large breasts, cat ears, and a cool personality.\nIf you can specify the pose, I would like her to be sitting on the floor (on her knees) smoking a cigarette.\nHe should be hatless, and if possible, the gun should be propped up against the wall.\n\nHere are some reference images\nhttps://skeb.jp/@rightleftagony/works/1\nhttps://skeb.jp/@910m27r/works/4\nhttps://skeb.jp/@fenganss/works/57\nhttps://twitter.com/yamabuki_border/status/1642085778749788160/photo/4\n\nAs for the size of the chest, please refer to the size of the top three pictures (sorry for the many orders m(_ _)m)\nThank you very much for your consideration with the above information!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aoisisioa/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1746722/uploads/origins/eb4dc37d-8af0-45f2-891b-dca8ebe2fe3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ae146325021121efd00d9ee9dbb527ac", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1746722/uploads/origins/eb4dc37d-8af0-45f2-891b-dca8ebe2fe3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ae146325021121efd00d9ee9dbb527ac, https://si.imgix.net/f1746722/uploads/origins/eb4dc37d-8af0-45f2-891b-dca8ebe2fe3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1203873a71a7d1512a4665d8f0e16c70 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f1746722/uploads/origins/eb4dc37d-8af0-45f2-891b-dca8ebe2fe3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Cc